+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know *según* + a source and reporting verbs such as *decir que* and *informar de que* from B1 Unit 13. Reporting keeps what a source says apart from what you say yourself. The coca leaf is a topic where people disagree, so it is useful to say clearly who says what."
     },
