         ],
         [
-          "La memoria colectiva custodió las canciones de Víctor Jara a pesar de la censura dictatorial.",
-          "Collective memory safeguarded Víctor Jara's songs despite dictatorial censorship."
+          "Después de que terminó la dictadura, se publicaron informes sobre las víctimas.",
+          "After the dictatorship ended, reports about the victims were published. (indicative)"
         ]
       ]
     },
